    {
      "text": "Each Authentication Service user can be assigned to different service entitlements and administrative entitlements depending on the role. You can also view the multi-factor authenticators that are configured for the user. You need to first add users, assign them to the subscribed Zscaler services, and then access the Users page to view the entitlements."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Viewing Entitlements",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Administration > Authentication > Users.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          63
        ],
        [
          66,
          71
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the name of the user.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The View User Details drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the View User Details drawer, select the Entitlements tab to view the assigned services.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          24
        ],
        [
          44,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Administrative entitlements are displayed only for users with admin roles.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Viewing Multi-Factor Authenticator",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Authentication > Users.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          37
        ],
        [
          40,
          45
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Edit icon for any user.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Edit User page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Edit User page, select the Security Settings section to view the configured multi-factor authenticators for the user. You can choose to delete the authenticators, except the email authenticator.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
